OL,3,AMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers call
OL,4,Afor new assisted dying legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers have
OL,7,Fwritten to Andy Burnham calling for new
OL,8,Fassisted dying legislation within the
OL,9,Fnext decade.
OL,11,FIn September MPs rejected proposals to
OL,12,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,13,FWales. The bill would have allowed
OL,14,Fadults with fewer than six months to
OL,15,Flive to apply to be given help to end
OL,16,Ftheir own life, subject to certain
OL,17,Fsafeguards.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
