OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMore than 50 Labour MPs and peers call
OL,4,Afor new assisted dying legislation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new letter said fresh legislation
OL,7,Fshould be brought forward within the
OL,8,Ftimescale of the prime minister's Ten
OL,9,FYear Plan, which will be published next
OL,10,Fmonth.
OL,12,FDowning Street told the BBC it was for
OL,13,FParliament rather than the government
OL,14,Fto decide if the law should change, and
OL,15,Fthe PM's priority was improving
OL,16,Fpalliative and social care.
